    "summary": "Ericsson has deployed its Radio Dot system at its six-floor Spanish headquarters in Madrid to act as showcase for indoor connectivity. In what appears a timely move, given the alarming shenanigans with Microsoft 365 and US airlines in the past week or so, Vodafone has partnered with the UK Resilience Academy to help strengthen the UK's preparedness for major disruption. The Academy, which also includes KPMG, SP Energy Networks and Serco as members, will seek to address what they call \"interconnected risks,\" namely cyberattacks, hybrid threats, geopolitical instability and supply chain failures. The companies intend to explore access to Cassava's \"AI Factory\" in Cape Town, South Africa, as an additional source of on-demand computing capacity for MT's AI offerings.",
