    "publishedAt": "2026-10-13",
    "summary": "That forward-looking identity has made it a natural partner for Lenovo in exploring how technology can meet the changing expectations of the next generation of sports fans. For leagues, teams, venues, and broadcasters, the opportunity is to use technology not simply as an attraction, but as a way to deepen fan relationships and create new value around content, live events, sponsors, partners, and premium audiences. The AI also produced more natural-looking footage, bringing the color balance of green-tinted night footage to 3.4x its original level while significantly reducing the heavy yellow tint in footage from the Monaco tunnel. Developed in under 30 days, the experience achieved more than 95% answer accuracy across the connected knowledge base and delivered responses in under one second.",
