    "summary": "Inference costs are projected to fall more than 90% by 2030, while it’s expected that agentic AI will drive 24x token consumption. The Dell AI Factory with NVIDIA delivers exactly that: one trusted partner offering the industry's broadest AI portfolio 7 with validated solutions, a growing open ecosystem, expert services and an end-to-end AI-ready data foundation, helping enterprises move from pilot to production with confidence. The Dell AI Factory with NVIDIA delivers secured, uniquely integrated AI solutions combining Dell-engineered systems, software and automation with a validated open ecosystem of leading AI software for enterprises to adopt proven AI outcomes faster and with less risk, on infrastructure they own and control. To meet this demand, Dell expands Dell Deskside Agentic AI with new validated reference deployment templates.",
