    "publishedAt": "2026-11-12",
    "summary": "Dedicated Medium Voltage Laboratory planned at the Global Large Power R&D and Customer Experience Center in Bologna, Italy, to accelerate next-generation AI power infrastructure. 12, 2026) — Vertiv Holdings Co. (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today introduced the Vertiv™ PowerNexus MV UPS , a medium-voltage power solution designed to help colocation, neocloud and hyperscale data center operators accelerate utility interconnection, optimize site utilization, and support evolving grid requirements. Designed for outdoor deployment at the point of connection, the solution provides continuous power protection while helping preserve valuable indoor space for revenue-generating compute. It also delivers up to 98.5% peak operating efficiency and can help reduce reliance on diesel generators.",
