    "publishedAt": "2026-11-17",
    "summary": "The expanded portfolio enables operators to meet rising power demands in next-generation AI data centers and scale infrastructure as compute requirements evolve. The Vertiv™ PowerDirect 9000 , 1.5 MW 800 VDC Power Center converts 480 VAC to 800 VDC for an entire row or pod. It distributes power via the Vertiv™ PowerBar Track DC busway and tap-off boxes to the Vertiv™ PowerDirect 3000, 90 kW 19” 800 VDC DC/DC Power Shelves in each rack. The system scales in 60 kW increments through 27 hot-pluggable power supply units.",
